  "summary": "In C6, the target SST for 2014-06-01 to 08-31 is compared with a per-cell 90th-percentile threshold. That threshold comes from \u00b15-day pools around baseline dates and is smoothed with a wrap-around \u00b115-day mean; only raw day-of-year 138\u2013259 (May 17\u2013Sep 15) feed the target days, so each baseline year contributes May 12\u2013Sep 20. Hot days then go through run detection and gap joining over all 60x60 region cells, restricted to sea cells, and the result is saved to mhw_mask.nc; the climatology is unused."
